---
export const prerender = false;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---


<Layout title="How It Works - NITKKR Food" description="Step-by-step guide on how to search menus, find food, and order on WhatsApp from NIT Kurukshetra vendors.">
  <section class="min-h-screen bg-nitkkr-cream py-12 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div class="text-center space-y-2">
        <a href="/" class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-nitkkr-orange mb-1 inline-block font-semibold">← Back to Home</a>
        <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-nitkkr-dark">📖 How NITKKR Food Works</h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">The fastest way to discover and order campus food in 3 simple steps.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-xs text-center space-y-3">
          <span class="text-4xl block">🔍</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-slate-900">1. Search & Filter</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Search for dishes (e.g. momos, egg rolls, shakes) or filter by <strong>High Protein 🏋️‍♂️</strong>, <strong>Late Night 🌙</strong>, or <strong>Under ₹50 💸</strong>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-xs text-center space-y-3">
          <span class="text-4xl block">⭐</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-slate-900">2. Check Menus & Reviews</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">View real prices, veg/non-veg tags, vendor timings, and authentic reviews from fellow NIT Kurukshetra students.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-xs text-center space-y-3">
          <span class="text-4xl block">💬</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-slate-900">3. 1-Tap WhatsApp Order</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Tap <strong>"Order on WhatsApp"</strong> to send a pre-filled greeting directly to the vendor owner. Zero commissions, zero middleman markups!</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-nitkkr-orange rounded-3xl p-8 text-white text-center space-y-4 shadow-md">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold">Are you a Campus Vendor Owner?</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/90 max-w-lg mx-auto">Get your vendor eatery and dishes listed in front of thousands of hungry students every day for free.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-white text-nitkkr-orange font-bold text-xs rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-sm">
          List Your Vendor Today →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

